        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Mandrake Root\", \"Shades of Deep Purple\"\n- Companies: Deep Purple\n- Places: Hertford, London's Rainbow Theatre\n- Events: 1972 Rainbow Theatre concert, 1975 Guinness Book of World Records listing\n\nFacts:\n- Deep Purple formed in Hertford in 1968.\n- \"Mandrake Root\" is a song by Deep Purple that appears on their debut album \"Shades of Deep Purple\".\n- Deep Purple were called \"the globe's loudest band\" in the 1975 Guinness Book of World Records for a 1972 concert at London's Rainbow Theatre.\n- Deep Purple have sold over 100 million albums worldwide.",
